    "legend": "<p>Malignant adenomyoepithelioma&nbsp;with a biphasic proliferation of epithelial and myoepithelial cells&nbsp;and areas displaying papillary architecture. Necrosis, haemorrhage and skin erosion are present. Nuclear atypia is seen in both epithelial and myoepithelial components. Mitoses number up to 9 per 10 high power fields, field diameter 0.6mm.</p>",
